DESCRIPTION:National Chinese Take-Out Day falls on November 5 and has no do
 cumented founder — but the object it celebrates has one of the best-docu
 mented origins in American food. The folded paper carton is a patented inv
 ention: US Patent 529\,053\, granted in 1894 to a Chicago man\, for a pail
  to carry oysters. Chinese food arrived in it later\, and the story of how
  runs through American immigration law as much as through cooking.\n\nhttp
 s://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-chinese-take-out-day/
